  "title": "Event Registration Consent Form",
  "subtitle": "Capture event admission, ticket class, session choice, and accommodation; confirm payment reference and check-in status.",
  "description": "Event Registration records event admission, ticket class, session choice, accommodation, payment reference, and check-in status. Event Registration evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this event registration scoped consent when staff must document event admission and ticket class. Reconcile session choice, accommodation, payment reference, and check-in status before the event registration handoff. Use the registration record, ticket or admission selection, payment receipt reference, session inventory, accommodation acknowledgment, confirmation message, and check-in scan. This record establishes attendee admission through ticket type, session inventory, purchaser contact, confirmation barcode, accommodation routing, payment reference, and check-in eligibility. It may also distinguish access tiers, guest passes, promotional codes, refund status, transferability, QR delivery, door-list lookup, and badge-printing readiness. Ask the assigned event registration reviewer to confirm event admission against the organization's policy.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
